; Linen-cart canvas — a heavier, greyer cloth than props/paper_mat's pinned
; sheets and drip-bag plastic. Fully rough (no sheen at all, unlike vinyl or
; ticking) so the sack reads as slack woven fabric rather than another
; moulded-plastic surface, which is what actually separates it from the bin
; and bag materials sitting right next to it in a corridor.

